---
description: Project conventions for StockWhy
alwaysApply: true
---
- Never hardcode outputs. Every conclusion must be computed from the data at run time.
- The agent code under app/ must never read scripts/_truth/ or any planted-cause file.
- Keep the repo light: no data files over 5 MB; generated data stays in data/generated/ (git-ignored).
- Every agent step writes an event to the trace (app/trace.py).
- Sponsor clients live in app/tools/ and keep the same interface as the offline adapter.
- Never commit keys. Use .env (git-ignored) and keep .env.example placeholders only.
- Keep main runnable: run `python scripts/evaluate.py` before merging.
